# Title: UAC Bypass Using DismHost
# ID: 853e74f9-9392-4935-ad3b-2e8c040dae86
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-08-30
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
# Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using DismHost DLL hijacking (UACMe 63)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.parent.executable:*C:\\Users\\* AND process.parent.executable:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* AND process.parent.executable:*\\DismHost.exe*) AND (IntegrityLevel:"High" OR IntegrityLevel:"System" OR IntegrityLevel:"S-1-16-16384" OR IntegrityLevel:"S-1-16-12288"))
